<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Prohibited misuse</h2>
  <p>Do not use AEGIS PDNS for unlawful activity, abuse, evasion of sanctions, malware operations, or attacks.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Abuse handling</h2>
  <p>SecretChip may investigate abuse reports, request context, and coordinate remediation actions.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Right to restrict or suspend</h2>
  <p>SecretChip may restrict, rate-limit, or suspend abusive usage to protect service integrity and users.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Fair-use for public endpoints</h2>
  <p>Public endpoint access is subject to reasonable use expectations. Excessive automated load may be controlled.</p>
</div>

<div class="legal-section">
  <h2>Lawful use expectations</h2>
  <p>Users are responsible for compliance with applicable laws and regulations in relevant jurisdictions.</p>
</div>
